description:
cron-dialect-convert: Cron Dialect Convert API: moves a schedule between crontab, GitHub Actions, Cron Hub, Quartz and Cloudflare Workers Cron Triggers so it fires at exactly the same times. No language model. $0.005 USDC per call (1 cent is this catalog's minimum).
Method: POST
Input: {"source": "crontab|github|cronhub|quartz|cloudflare, required", "target": "same values, required", "schedule": "string, required", "timezone": "string, optional"}
